@host  = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.token}}

###
### ① 先发这条登录（管理员）拿 token，新增/修改/停用/绑定都要用
### ============================================================
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "897393"
}

###
### ============================================================
### #11 自提点列表 — 只查启用项（status=1），游客也能看
### 响应 data：{ total, pages, list[] } 或直接数组，见 PickupPointVO
### ============================================================
GET {{host}}/api/pickup-points?status=1

###
### #11 自提点列表 — 关键词模糊匹配名称
### ============================================================
GET {{host}}/api/pickup-points?keyword=阳光

###
### #11 自提点详情
### ============================================================
GET {{host}}/api/pickup-points/1

###
### ============================================================
### #11 新增自提点（需 ROLE_ADMIN）
### 成功：data = { id, name, status }
### ============================================================
POST {{host}}/api/pickup-points
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "http示例自提点",
  "address": "示例路 1 号",
  "contact": "王团长",
  "phone": "13900139000"
}

###
### #11 修改自提点（需 ROLE_ADMIN）
### 只传要改的字段；不传的字段保持原值
### ============================================================
PUT {{host}}/api/pickup-points/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "阳光小区自提点（改名测试）",
  "address": "示例路 2 号",
  "contact": "王团长",
  "phone": "13900139001"
}

###
### #11 停用自提点（逻辑删除：status 置 0，不物理删除）
### ============================================================
DELETE {{host}}/api/pickup-points/16
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============================================================
### #12 团长绑定自提点（需 ROLE_ADMIN）
### 规则：leader.point_id 有唯一索引 uk_point_id，
###       已被别的团长绑定 → code=10016
### 注意：路径里的 {id} 是 **leader 表主键**，不是 user_id
### ============================================================
PUT {{host}}/api/leaders/1/bind-point
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pointId": 2
}

###
### #12 绑定冲突样例 —— 把 pointId 换成已被别人占用的自提点，期望 code=10016
### ============================================================
PUT {{host}}/api/leaders/1/bind-point
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pointId": 1
}

###
### ② 再发这条登录（居民 user1），下面那条 403 样例要用它的 token
### ============================================================
# @name loginResident
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "897393"
}

###
### 无权限样例 —— 用居民 token 调绑定接口，期望 HTTP 403
### ============================================================
PUT {{host}}/api/leaders/1/bind-point
Authorization: Bearer {{loginResident.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pointId": 3
}
